Responsibilities of SecurityConfig

SecurityConfig
│
├── Configure SecurityFilterChain
├── Configure JWT Filter
├── Configure AuthenticationManager
├── Configure PasswordEncoder
├── Configure Public URLs
├── Configure Protected URLs
├── Disable CSRF (for REST APIs)
├── Configure Stateless Session
└── Configure Exception Handling

Notice it does not:

Generate JWTs
Validate JWTs
Load users
Log requests

It only wires everything together.


